      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-20b620a6ce31d429176a6dfa",
        "path_or_url": "weather.md",
        "section": "Weather decisions > Suspension",
        "snippet": "## Suspension\n\nSuspend outdoor observations when the wind interlock opens. Preserve reservation identifiers during suspension. Resume only after the interlock closes and the duty operator records a restart approval.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "5d1edf4b7ee97f1b2c5ec3fda6ce63a0d833400e98961bae8561f3a746e99c7a",
        "project_identity": "local:ff995e7a5b787e3a6bd0480c8c917249162958c76a73bebfae066060416c4458",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 8,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/30a253b007a2632cdb953b4c"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-22477807e40ac7a65ea02c0c",
        "path_or_url": "weather.md",
        "section": "Weather decisions > Indoor instrument",
        "snippet": "## Indoor instrument\n\nAn instrument explicitly classified as indoor may continue during a wind suspension, provided its own safety interlocks remain closed. A roof visible as closed on the calendar does not establish indoor classification.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "0dcbe0e75b674f165d70e740ecb19ac8feecfbead6a91aabaa79b464ab1131dd",
        "project_identity": "local:ff995e7a5b787e3a6bd0480c8c917249162958c76a73bebfae066060416c4458",
        "line_start": 9,
        "line_end": 12,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/ca4b8a45b75f8ab44b952af7"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-e56d0e655ec8157f6f77cd81",
        "path_or_url": "weather.md",
        "section": "Weather decisions > Forecast display",
        "snippet": "## Forecast display\n\nThe forecast panel predicts wind for planning. A favourable forecast is not an interlock signal and cannot authorize a restart.\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "2c719f6ee9eed18cc0acad7cdbcd4e00af2b7600efe4ad74fb33e7b176cba2ec",
